Data Sources:

Earthquake data is provided by the United States Geological Survey (USGS)
Earthquake Hazards Program:
- API: https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/feed/v1.0/
- Data is in the public domain and provided without warranty

Earth texture: Equirectangular projection. Primary: Three.js examples (earth_atmos_2048.jpg, NASA Blue Marble). Fallback: Wikimedia Commons. Provides base geography; earthquake overlays use vertex coloring.

